--- !u!114 &1133638708
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1133638705}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c8aa3f3cae44ad24590de72453d413b7, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 31e4fbd2b8922a94ba608fa6eea202d2, type: 2}
  message: Down here, I've got peace, quiet, and a constant temperature. No landlord
    breathing down my neck, no nosy neighbors, and certainly no tax collectors. The
    occasional rat? A far better companion than most humans I've known. Now, if you're
    done gawking at my lifestyle choices, perhaps we could discuss something of actual
    importance?
  responses: []
--- !u!114 &1133638709
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1133638705}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c8aa3f3cae44ad24590de72453d413b7, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 31e4fbd2b8922a94ba608fa6eea202d2, type: 2}
  message: Does that unsettle you? Well, life doesn't always deal a fair hand. This
    place, with all its... peculiarities, still trumps the nauseating stench of politics
    and social climbing you lot endure up there.
  responses: []
