    - target: {fileID: 3636146190174469167, guid: 0e8cf6f8eb5af5f4ba8caf60c0d208c3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: message
      value: Name's Drent. I see you've dealt with those thieves, eh? About time
        someone drove them out of my dwelling. It's been unbearable down here, what
        with all their love ballads about their leader. Now, I can finally rest easy,
        with naught but the soothing sound of flowing water to bless my dreams.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
